What:		/proc/boost_pool/camera
What:		/proc/boost_pool/ion_boost_pool_uncached
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru
Description:
	Read/write control and status for the cached camera and uncached ION
	page-reserve pools. Reading reports current and configured watermarks plus
	per-order page counts. Writing 0 restores the original watermarks, -1
	stops refilling, and a larger positive page count requests asynchronous
	prefill.

